uld suggest we need more info before final decision. But guidelines say we should aim for convergence, but we can still keep B.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent 2 just said they remain convinced B is best despite lack of evidence on decision quality, etc. We can agree and reinforce, maybe note that the missing data on B is a risk but still less than other candidates' deficits. Provide explicit facts: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at weather assessment, excellent computer skills; concerns: pretentious, wrong tone, grumpy, uncooperative. Also note that other candidates have issues: C communication, D moody, A unorganized, etc.\n\nThus we will state we continue to recommend Candidate B.\n\nMake sure to include explicit facts and explain why they matter.\n\nNow produce output."}
